<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 30.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 30.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- German Post and Telecommunications Minister Wolfgang Boetsch starts on Monday a visit to Tunisia for talks with Tunisian officials.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- In an address to the Security Council on Saturday in New York, Tunisian Foreign Affairs Minister Habib Ben Yahia denounces Israel's new  provocations against Palestinians and peace.</p>
</text>
